WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.950
- All right, we have
reached the end of the show

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:04.170
but there's just enough time
for one more story, y'all.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.070
This is "What I'm Liking".

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:07.471
(upbeat music)

00:00:07.471 --> 00:00:08.304
(audience applauds)

00:00:08.304 --> 00:00:10.230
Okay, so I love sharing new artists

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:12.540
and so does my music
director, Jason Halbert.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:14.940
He introduced me to a
singer/songwriter named,

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:17.190
Aaliyah Sheffield who first got attention

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:18.300
during the pandemic.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.520
Aaliyah uploaded videos of herself singing

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.470
which led to a recording contract.

00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:24.607
This summer, she released an EP titled,

00:00:24.607 --> 00:00:27.045
"These Songs are for Anyone Sick of Earth"

00:00:27.045 --> 00:00:28.200
(Kelly and audience laughing)

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.250
which is awesome.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.362
Say hi to Aaliyah Sheffield everybody.

00:00:31.362 --> 00:00:33.443
(audience applauds)

00:00:33.443 --> 00:00:34.276
Hi.

00:00:34.276 --> 00:00:36.240
- What's up Aaliyah?
- Hi.

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:37.080
- Hi.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.630
- Look at your setup, oh my gosh.

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:40.787
- Yes.

00:00:40.787 --> 00:00:42.240
- So you took time to do music right?

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:44.040
During the pandemic, right?

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:45.960
- Yes, that's all I do.

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:46.793
- Yes.

00:00:46.793 --> 00:00:48.570
Did you find yourself to be more inspired

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:50.117
during that time as well?

00:00:50.117 --> 00:00:52.680
- Yeah, I think I was
more inspired to write.

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:56.490
With just a lot going on, and
instead of ranting online,

00:00:56.490 --> 00:01:00.600
I ranted in songs and then
posted those online instead.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:02.250
- Well, I love Aaliyah's lyrics.

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:05.370
So like this line, "I ate
one of your little friends.

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:07.020
I will key your car.

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:08.670
Put sugar in your tank.

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:11.790
Make you remember who
I am and who I ain't."

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:12.623
- Yes.

00:01:12.623 --> 00:01:15.130
- If you wanna write a song for
me anytime, I would love it.

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:15.963
I was like...

00:01:15.963 --> 00:01:17.328
- I would love to.

00:01:17.328 --> 00:01:18.852
I love your voice.

00:01:18.852 --> 00:01:20.167
You are amazing.

00:01:20.167 --> 00:01:21.030
- So I would love to.
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:21.030 --> 00:01:23.400
- Well, I feel like your
lyrics could go any way.

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:24.810
You could go R&amp;B, you could go pop,

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:26.400
you could go country with those lines.

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:28.650
Like any of those ladies
would key your car

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:29.700
I think at one time.

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:32.700
Anyone from those genres, like, I love it.

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.260
Thank you so much for
just being inspiring.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:35.610
We love to like, highlight artists

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:37.470
that maybe everybody
hasn't heard of quite yet.

00:01:37.470 --> 00:01:39.690
So thank you so much Aaliyah
for joining us today.

00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:42.090
I'm loving your post right now, right?

00:01:42.090 --> 00:01:42.923
- Yes.

00:01:42.923 --> 00:01:43.756
(audience applauds)

00:01:43.756 --> 00:01:45.367
- Aaliyah Sheffield's EP,

00:01:45.367 --> 00:01:49.020
"These Songs are for Anyone
Sick of Earth" is out now.

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:50.070
Y'all gotta check it out.

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:52.320
That title is incredible.

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:53.160
Alright everybody.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:55.080
So usually at this moment in the show,

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:57.000
we give our guest a thousand dollars

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.640
courtesy of our season-long
partner Pilot pen,

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:01.710
makers of FriXion, the
go to a erasable pen

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:03.150
of "The Kelly Clarkson Show".

00:02:03.150 --> 00:02:05.490
But Aaliyah is skyrocketing to the top.

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:06.323
She's doing all right.

00:02:06.323 --> 00:02:08.566
So today, it's going to be
someone in the audience.

00:02:08.566 --> 00:02:09.399
(audience cheers)

00:02:09.399 --> 00:02:10.800
So let's see who it is.

00:02:12.011 --> 00:02:15.294
Again, look at the
monitor to see your face.

00:02:15.294 --> 00:02:20.294
(audience continues
cheering and applauding)

00:02:22.935 --> 00:02:24.893
Who's it gonna be?

00:02:24.893 --> 00:02:27.643
(Shayla screams)

00:02:28.637 --> 00:02:30.090
Hi.

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:31.320
- Oh my gosh.

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:32.153
Hi Kelly.

00:02:32.153 --> 00:02:33.870
- [Kelly] Hello, what is your name?

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:34.920
- My name is Shayla.

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.200
- So Shayla, how do you think
you're gonna spend the money?

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:40.350
- I have loans to pay,
so that's the first thing

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:41.490
I need to cover.

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:43.650
- Okay, maybe take a
little bit and have fun.

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:44.483
Just like a tiny,

00:02:44.483 --> 00:02:45.600
- carve a little piece.
- Just a little bit.

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:47.670
- Yeah, and I also booked a trip to Greece

00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:48.660
for next year so...

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:49.710
- You're gonna love it.

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:50.940
- Yes.

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:52.080
- I love Greece.

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:52.913
- Yes.

00:02:52.913 --> 00:02:54.540
- You're gonna love it.

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:55.727
Carve out some of that money for fun.

00:02:55.727 --> 00:02:56.700
- [Shayla] Right, right.

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:59.550
- You know, be responsible
like, 85% of it.

00:02:59.550 --> 00:03:01.020
- [Shayla] Right, I'll try to be.

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:02.280
- Exactly, exactly.

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:03.960
Well, thank you so much
Shayla, for coming.

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:04.793
I'm so glad you got a grand.

00:03:04.793 --> 00:03:06.805
- Thank you Kelly, oh my goodness.

00:03:06.805 --> 00:03:08.974
- All right, thank you to
all our guests this hour,

00:03:08.974 --> 00:03:13.322
Bowen Yang, Tim, Juanita,
Jodie Long, Laura Terrell,

00:03:13.322 --> 00:03:15.789
Emily Kaufman, (indistinct)

00:03:15.789 --> 00:03:16.622
